{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find My Frogs - Paper</strong> are the printed version of characters and scenes from <strong>Find My Frogs</strong> game. Put your own colors on cute frogs and tiny scenes from Moss Glade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 \ud83c\udfa8\u00a0<strong>6 x coloring pages</strong> with characters and scenes from <strong>Find My Frogs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 \ud83d\udc38 Cute frogs and cozy village vibes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 \u2728 Relaxing drawing experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Accessing the DLC:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1.\u00a0 Open Steam, go to the Library tab, and right-click on Find My Frogs in your game list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.\u00a0 Select &quot;Manage&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3.\u00a0 Click &quot;Browse local files&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4.\u00a0 Open FindMyFrogs_Paper.pdf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5.\u00a0 Print</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897450?t=1753290345","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897450?t=1753290345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897450/f7102f3c53451c516253e67b5c5628389942541f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753290345","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897450/f7102f3c53451c516253e67b5c5628389942541f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753290345","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find My Frogs - Paper</strong> are the printed version of characters and scenes f